/-- **Stacks Project, Tag 01BY (2), relative form.** The kernel of a morphism from a sheaf of
modules generated by finitely many sections on the slice site over `W` to the restriction to `W`
of a coherent sheaf of modules is of finite type. -/
theorem isFiniteType_kernel_of_generatingSections {M : SheafOfModules.{t} R} [IsCoherent M]
    (W : C) {N : SheafOfModules.{t} (R.over W)} (σ : N.GeneratingSections) [Finite σ.I]
    (g : N ⟶ M.over W) : (kernel g).IsFiniteType :=
