stated as a theorem as well as through `coherentModules_isClosedUnderCokernels` because the
universe parameters of an `ObjectProperty` instance over a site with three independent universes
are not solvable by instance search at a site where they coincide — `max t u =?= u` is not a
unification problem Lean solves — whereas a theorem takes them from the type of `φ`. -/
